## Sources

1. A. de Moivre, *The Doctrine of Chances*, 2nd ed., London (1738) (the normal curve as a limit of the binomial).
2. C. F. Gauss, *Theoria motus corporum coelestium*, Hamburg (1809) (the normal law of errors).
3. W. Feller, *An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications*, vol. 2, 2nd ed., Wiley (1971), chapter 1.
4. S. M. Ross, *A First Course in Probability*, 9th ed., Pearson (2014), chapter 5.
